{"compact": {"ja_sv": "Utskottets förslag: att avslå motionsyrkandena (nuvarande ordning behålls).", "nej_sv": "Stöd för motförslaget: reservation 1 från SD.", "avstar_sv": "Partiet markerar en egen linje som inte finns med i slutomröstningens två alternativ.", "ja_en": "The committee proposal: rejecting the motions (keeping things as they are).", "nej_en": "Backing the counter-proposal: reservation 1 by SD.", "avstar_en": "The party marks a position of its own that is not one of the two final alternatives."}, "en": {"rubrik": "Protection against discrimination", "dok_titel": "Freedoms and rights", "forslag_text": "Parliament rejects the motions \n\n2024/25:804 by Ulrika Westerlund et al. (MP) item 2, \n\n2024/25:1375 by Matheus Enholm et al. (SD) items 3 and 4, \n\n2024/25:1379 by Matheus Enholm et al. (SD) item 2 and \n\n2024/25:3159 by Malin Björk et al. (C) item 1.3.", "notis": "Parliament rejected approximately 50 proposals concerning freedoms and rights submitted as motions during the general motion period 2024. Parliament refers, among other things, to earlier and ongoing work on the issues that the proposals concern.\nThe proposals concern, among other things, the right to court review, constitutional protection of the right to abortion, revocation of citizenship, discrimination, and the security and safety work of religious communities.", "alternatives": ["Parliament rejects the motions \n\n2024/25:804 by Ulrika Westerlund et al. (MP) item 2, \n\n2024/25:1375 by Matheus Enholm et al. (SD) items 3 and 4, \n\n2024/25:1379 by Matheus Enholm et al. (SD) item 2 and \n\n2024/25:3159 by Malin Björk et al. (C) item 1.3.", "Reservation 1"]}, "votering_id": "FAE2046F-7181-470A-BB94-9C909864B0B9", "rm": "2024/25", "beteckning": "KU25", "punkt": 4, "dok_id": "HC01KU25", "datum": "2025-04-09", "utskott": "KU", "rubrik": "Diskrimineringsskyddet", "dok_titel": "Fri- och rättigheter", "sammanfattning": "Konstitutionsutskottet föreslår att riksdagen säger nej till cirka 50 